Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.36,0:00:07.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:11.08,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.81,0:00:20.97,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.96,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.36,0:00:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.21,0:00:33.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:37.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:40.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:44.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.81,0:00:47.80,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:50.65,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.67,0:00:54.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.24,0:00:57.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.17,0:01:00.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:03.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:06.57,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.65,0:01:19.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.17,0:01:22.09,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:25.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.33,0:01:28.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.17,0:01:32.81,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.44,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.72,0:01:53.20,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1635,441)\fad(300,300)}Cultivation Union
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.29,0:02:17.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This dance has 30% of the charm of a Celestial's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.77,0:02:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very good,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,you shall be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.41,0:02:23.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Serving the Celestial Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.25,0:02:25.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,is already a heavenly blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.01,0:02:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Disciple doesn't dare to ask for more...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:35.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you are so sincere,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:36.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.13,0:02:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,shall reward you with bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.37,0:02:41.25,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1695,546)\fad(300,300)}Huang Yu\NCelestial Ancestor\Nof the Cultivation Union\NMiddle stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Celestial Ancestor...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:55.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,for your blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Feng.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.09,0:03:05.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today, regardless of your cultivation level...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.09,0:03:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,They walk on clouds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:08.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,and use jade as tiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.89,0:03:11.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place looks like the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:18.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why do these Celestial Seeds
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.13,0:03:20.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,feel so familiar ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:22.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.17,0:03:24.97,Card Hard,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,000)\pos(1469,553)}Quyi Chang\NHeavenly Fate Sect Blue Division disciple\NLate stage Soul Transformation
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:24.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:27.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never thought we would meet again here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.61,0:03:30.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,I admired your demeanor from afar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.29,0:03:32.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,during Master's birthday banquet back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:34.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Quyi Chang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.09,0:03:36.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Brother, why didn't you join an army for military merit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.05,0:03:37.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,or try to seek opportunities
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:39.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,instead of leisurely idling here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.37,0:03:43.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those are just facades to fool outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.93,0:03:45.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This place
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.01,0:03:47.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,is where the true opportunities of Demon Spirit Land are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.85,0:03:49.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the true door to the Great Dao !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.33,0:03:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Ancestor is a true celestial from the Celestial Realm !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.13,0:03:53.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,And we,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.89,0:03:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,when he uses his celestial spell on us,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.49,0:03:59.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,can have a glimpse at the Great Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.29,0:04:01.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,and follow the true path of celestials !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:03.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Brother must be here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.37,0:04:05.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,to pledge allegiance to the Celestial Ancestor too, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Nowadays,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,even demons and ghosts dare to call themselves Celestial Ancestors...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.53,0:04:16.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who insult the Celestial Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:18.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,must die !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.69,0:04:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:20.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.61,0:04:21.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Kill !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:41.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your blasphemy is considered a crime !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.33,0:04:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,You deserve to die without a grave !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.81,0:04:50.09,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1640,511)\fad(300,300)}Celestial Guardian\NCultivation Union member\NEarly stage Ascendant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Blasphemer...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.05,0:04:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Die !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.25,0:04:54.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Guardians
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:56.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,are the personal guards created by the Celestial Ancestor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:04:59.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're all Ascendant cultivators.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,You will die without a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,They're just puppets with an empty cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.81,0:05:08.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,They don't even have domains.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.05,0:05:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How can they be as strong as an Ascendant ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.45,0:05:21.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,still won't show yourself ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.85,0:05:25.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who are you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.49,0:05:29.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare you trespass into my territory ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.69,0:05:32.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,You already attacked me once
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.65,0:05:33.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,in Sky Demon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.33,0:05:35.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,You did it again yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.77,0:05:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and have provoked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.37,0:05:39.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now you pretend to not know me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:42.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,The assassination atempt in Sky Demon City ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.65,0:05:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.13,0:05:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is Wang Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.57,0:05:49.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fellow cultivator Wang,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.01,0:05:51.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,it was a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.25,0:05:54.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you killed two of my Celestial Guardians,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:56.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,that makes us even.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.81,0:05:57.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.93,0:05:59.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,write off our grievances !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.17,0:06:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't owe each other anything from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.33,0:06:03.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.09,0:06:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Ancestor is Middle stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.65,0:06:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.81,0:06:08.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you avoiding him ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.81,0:06:14.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Guardians
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:15.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,are just two pieces of broken jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.77,0:06:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,How does that make us even ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.45,0:06:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're going too far...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:25.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Guardians, appear
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.41,0:06:26.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,and summon the Emperor !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.21,0:06:37.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Celestial Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:40.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,We pay respects to the Celestial Emperor !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:46.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I come from the Celestial Realm !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.69,0:06:49.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the Celestial Realm shattered, I descended to this place
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:51.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,to enlighten all living beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.93,0:06:52.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.09,0:06:54.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can keep living
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:56.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you withdraw now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:57.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you insist on being arrogant,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.45,0:07:00.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,celestial punishment will fall upon you !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.77,0:07:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial punishment ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.21,0:07:04.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your illusion spell
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:06.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,is far too lacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.09,0:07:42.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The illusion was clever
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.45,0:07:44.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it's only a fake after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.37,0:07:48.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your Ascendant cultivation was forcibly raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.65,0:07:51.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just like those Celestial Guardians,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.73,0:07:53.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,your heart lacks any comprehension of the Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.81,0:07:55.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,and there's no trace of origin energy in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.85,0:07:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.41,0:08:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,from your fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.53,0:08:07.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.29,0:08:10.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I, a celestial, consider your cultivation hard-earned !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:12.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you're too arrogant
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.29,0:08:13.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,and keep harassing me !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since it's come to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I'll make you a slave with my Celestial Seeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.21,0:08:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,unable to live
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,and unable to beg for death !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.25,0:08:24.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Seed...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.05,0:08:26.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Begin !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.13,0:08:35.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as the Celestial Seed can make him lose his senses for a moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.97,0:08:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can refine him into a Celestial Guardian with the celestial jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:43.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This aura...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.09,0:08:46.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Beast Feeds ?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.81,0:08:56.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.81,0:08:57.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Qilin !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:00.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.25,0:09:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,These things have a deep connection to the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.97,0:09:16.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person must have other treasures on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:20.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.53,0:09:23.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.97,0:09:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You destroyed my centuries of work !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,With such meager skill,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:42.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,how dare you call yourself a celestial ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.73,0:09:43.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare be so arrogant !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:47.09,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1597,435)}Celestial Brush
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:46.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,This brush
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,is how I enlighten all living beings !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:53.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ignorant child,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.53,0:09:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's time to die !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This symbol...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.21,0:10:03.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's the same as the ones in the fourth fake cave !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.49,0:10:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,This brush
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.21,0:10:10.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,can truly draw out the power of those golden symbols.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:11.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,That look in his eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.21,0:10:15.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,is exactly the same as when that Qilin saw the Celestial Beast Feeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Rune,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.85,0:10:19.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,slash !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:20.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thunder Beast,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:21.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,break !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.53,0:10:34.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.29,0:10:35.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Beast Feeds,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:38.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial jades, a Celestial Brush...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.49,0:10:40.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must plunder this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.85,0:10:48.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,He used 6 different spells in 30 breaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.25,0:10:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person's methods for fleeing are endless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:56.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Qilin...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.13,0:10:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,A Thunder Beast !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:00.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of monster is he !?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.05,0:11:10.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's my fault... my fault...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.85,0:11:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I weren't so greedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:13.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:15.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be in such a situation !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.25,0:11:19.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I originally thought
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,that Wang Lin was just an ordinary cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.45,0:11:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,That refining him into a guardian was already showing mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.29,0:11:28.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who would have thought he was such a monster !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.89,0:11:30.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.73,0:11:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,if I can survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.93,0:11:35.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,abandoning my artifact doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.73,0:11:40.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,You have to choose: chase me or take the brush !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.17,0:11:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wang Lin, think carefully !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.57,0:11:45.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,I never liked making choices.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.89,0:11:50.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,You can count on me to handle it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.25,0:11:51.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll definitely bring the artifact back !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.81,0:11:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Damn it, damn it, damn it !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.49,0:11:59.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,How could he be so shameless !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:03.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I can escape this calamity,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.89,0:12:06.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,I swear I will never stir up trouble again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:09.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.45,0:12:12.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have one last trick !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:13.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,I beg you !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.37,0:12:17.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Capture Net...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:19.89,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1584,442)\fad(300,300)}Celestial Capture Net
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.41,0:12:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Activate !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.81,0:12:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although I haven't mastered you yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.69,0:12:29.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I believe you will definitely help me survive this calamity !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.09,0:12:30.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trap him !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.85,0:12:31.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trap him !!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.81,0:12:33.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Trap him !!!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:34.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:52.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Again !?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.65,0:12:53.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Capture Net,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.45,0:12:54.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,your previous owner
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.37,0:12:56.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,must have died because of you !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.13,0:13:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such a good celestial artifact...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:13.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ruonan !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:19.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.45,0:13:21.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ruonan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.41,0:13:25.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Brother Wang
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.53,0:13:26.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,for saving our lives !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.25,0:13:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,H...he... he...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.97,0:13:44.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,wouldn't dare to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.09,0:13:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,W...without...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.89,0:13:45.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Without me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.45,0:13:46.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,the celestial artifacts...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.65,0:13:47.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,H...he...he...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.53,0:13:49.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,won't be able to use a single one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.25,0:13:54.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.37,0:13:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Little Xu has retrieved this artifact for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.93,0:13:58.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Th...this...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.57,0:14:00.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm completely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.85,0:14:02.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:06.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,This Celestial Brush is useless in your hands !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.93,0:14:07.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let me go
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.85,0:14:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I'll tell you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.09,0:14:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,how to draw that golden symbol.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:12.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,How about it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.01,0:14:15.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:41.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spare me, Celestial Emperor !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.89,0:14:42.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spare me, Celestial Emperor !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Have mercy, Celestial Emperor...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.65,0:14:47.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's your true identity ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.29,0:14:49.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celest...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.01,0:14:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your excellency, Celestial Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.57,0:14:54.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,this humble one is from the Refining Feather Sect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.61,0:14:55.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,My name is Huang Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:56.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I...I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.97,0:14:59.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,I accidentally entered a celestial cave years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:03.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,and thus obtained various artifacts from the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:05.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,After that... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.13,0:15:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I disguised myself as a celestial of the Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides the Celestial Beast Feed and the Celestial Brush,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.49,0:15:11.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,what else did you obtain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.05,0:15:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,There were 2 bags of holding !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.53,0:15:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,One bag contained
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:19.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Celestial Capture Net and a jade slip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.57,0:15:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Th...The other bag
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.77,0:15:23.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,had a Divine Sense restriction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.25,0:15:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I hadn't opened it yet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:26.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,when... when...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:29.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,when it was snatched away by a couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.29,0:15:43.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,My daughter, Qing Shuang,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:47.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,I congratulate you on becoming the Celestial King of the Rain Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.89,0:15:51.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father has forged a sword sheath for you out of Shuo Celestial Metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.77,0:15:54.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can nourish the Sword Spirit within your Rain Celestial Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:56.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade slip
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.61,0:15:57.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,has a restriction
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.17,0:15:59.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,that requires our bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,You only need to use a drop of your blood to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:04.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the restriction will disappear on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.13,0:16:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.05,0:16:08.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,will its mysteries be revealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:10.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Judging by the tone of this jade slip,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.65,0:16:14.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,this Qing Shuang was the ruler of the Rain Celestial Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.85,0:16:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,This woman had an artifact
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.97,0:16:18.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,called the Rain Celestial Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rain Celestial Sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.73,0:16:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rain Celestial Realm...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.81,0:16:26.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are no such things as coincidences in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.73,0:16:29.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The woman Senior Zhou Yi fell in love with
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.29,0:16:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,is Qing Shuang, the daughter of Celestial Emperor Qing Lin !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:40.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.37,0:16:42.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.69,0:16:55.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first artifact is the Brush of Celestial Touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.93,0:16:58.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This brush condenses the essence of yin energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:02.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father collected 12 suns to turn them into 12 symbols
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.85,0:17:04.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,that can be drawn by this brush.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.05,0:17:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,In the future, when you use this brush,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can perform myriads of transformations
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:11.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to wield celestial spells.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.13,0:17:14.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The second is the Celestial Capture Net.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.17,0:17:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,This artifact's spirit
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:17.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,has just awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The artifact was lost to the mortal world
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:22.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,and used during past wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:23.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,It is quite interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:26.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,It should suit your taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.05,0:17:28.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The third
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.45,0:17:31.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,needs to be paired with the Rain Celestial Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.05,0:17:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's called the Spirit Sheath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.29,0:17:38.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Place the celestial sword within the sheath to strengthen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.13,0:17:39.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,It can help the Sword Spirit to condense
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:42.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,and grow increasingly powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:45.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Besides the method for refining Celestial Guardians,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.29,0:17:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,there is also the Stop spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.69,0:17:49.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although it is a low quality celestial spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.41,0:17:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's profound and mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.25,0:17:52.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father obtained it by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.77,0:17:56.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,This spell may be the fragment of another ancient spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:18:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I leave it to you to study it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.13,0:18:06.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,This jade slip also contains a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.49,0:18:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,It looks to be a map of the true celestial cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:13.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,But we don't yet know where it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.29,0:18:15.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Celestial Guardians are divided into upper, middle, and lower grades.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.53,0:18:18.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even the weakest lower-grade Celestial Guardian
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.25,0:18:21.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,is comparable to Peak Late stage Ascendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:24.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The ones Huang Yu refined
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:26.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,were clearly some failed attempts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.57,0:18:29.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,They would be of little use in the battle against the Fire Demon Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.21,0:18:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,The best thing I obtained
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:34.29,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1588,462)}Stop spell\NLow grade celestial spell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:35.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,is this low quality celestial spell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.57,0:18:39.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,A true celestial spell
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.97,0:18:43.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,is something cultivators desperately seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I master this Stop spell,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might be able to turn the tide
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.93,0:18:50.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the battle against the Fire Demon Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this battle...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.29,0:18:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Fire Demon Spirit will surely be stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.09,0:18:56.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ordinary methods will be of little use.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.61,0:19:00.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only by relying on spells and artifacts
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.25,0:19:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,will I have a slim chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.85,0:19:05.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Scattered Devil Armor
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.77,0:19:07.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Ling Tianhou's sword energy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:10.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,should be enough to stay alive at the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.41,0:19:14.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Underworld River is powerful
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.33,0:19:16.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,but it will be hard to confront the Fire Demon Spirit head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.45,0:19:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I also use teleportation spells,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:20.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,I might surprise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Soul Flag and the celestial sword
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,if used properly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:27.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,might be able to block one strike.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:30.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although the God Slaying Chariot is powerful,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.89,0:19:33.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,it likely isn't enough to injure the Fire Demon Spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:36.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it comes to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.85,0:19:37.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,this Stop spell
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.57,0:19:39.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,might come in use.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:02.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)\pos(960,534)}70 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:23.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sky Demon Country and Fire Demon Country have been at war for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.61,0:20:25.77,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1567,526)\fad(300,300)}Commander-in-Chief Lei\NFire Demon Country\NRank 300 000 Demonic Energy\N(Early stage Ascendant)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.05,0:20:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gu Yundun still dares to keep attacking with his army ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,He clearly doesn't take us seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.25,0:20:30.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.45,0:20:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,our two armies
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.77,0:20:34.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,will take his Sky Demon City
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.85,0:20:36.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,and destroy his capital !
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.41,0:20:40.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Only by swiftly capturing Sky Demon City
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.57,0:20:43.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,can we put Gu Yundun in a dilemma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.61,0:20:45.57,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1561,551)\fad(300,300)}Commander-in-Chief Shui\NFire Demon Country\NRank 300 000 Demonic Energy\N(Early stage Ascendant)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.89,0:20:48.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This barbarian tribe must also be eradicated
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.61,0:20:51.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to avoid revealing our army's movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.89,0:20:55.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Barbarian scum,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.73,0:20:56.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,die !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.49,0:21:04.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,This formation is quite interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.77,0:21:06.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Allow me to break it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.65,0:21:08.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,and give it to the Emperor !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.21,0:21:39.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.93,0:22:29.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,What...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.89,0:22:31.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,happened ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.65,0:22:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Stop spell
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.29,0:22:41.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,can only immobilize for 3 breaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.29,0:22:45.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,I still haven't fully mastered this celestial spell
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.17,0:22:48.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I don't have time to keep studying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.17,0:22:51.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,My deadline with the Demon Spirit is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.29,0:22:53.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's time to set off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.29,0:22:57.37,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1648,461)}Fire Demon City\NFire Demon Country
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.45,0:23:45.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,This demonic formation accumulated energy for millennia.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.45,0:23:47.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's been this strong from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.45,0:23:48.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,We suffered heavy losses in this war
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.97,0:23:50.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the Ancestor orders us to continue the siege.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.77,0:23:52.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,What are his true intentions ?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.41,0:24:02.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,1 000 000 strands of slaughter energy...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.49,0:24:03.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Gather !
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.17,0:24:19.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me...
